          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: приставка",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "приставка (pristávka) — \"a games console; a prefix\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "На день рождения сын получил игровую приставку. Na den rozhdéniya syn poluchíl igrovúyu pristávku. For his birthday my son got a games console."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Игровая приставка (pristávka) — a games console. In grammar, a prefix."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "приставка (pristávka) is built on приставить 'to put next to, to attach', from ставить 'to stand, to put'; EtymDB lists the word without a source."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
